      "id": "claim_140b6bf39aa840888738d98384661e1b",
      "statement": "Per-host runbook directories (docs/03-runbooks/HX-N/) are five-line wrappers that exec the shared block in docs/03-runbooks/common/ with the host name as the sole argument, carrying no logic of their own; the two invocation forms ./HX-4/01-base-admin-network-updates.sh and ./common/01-base-admin-network-updates.sh hx-4 are equivalent.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/03-runbooks/HX-4/01-base-admin-network-updates.sh",
